sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Browser
  participant F as Next.js UI
  participant A as Django API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL/pgvector
  participant Q as Redis/Celery
  participant AI as Mock or Gemini
  U->>F: Ask question
  F->>A: POST /workspaces/{ws}/ask + JWT + Idempotency-Key
  A->>DB: Verify membership, quotas, prior key
  A->>AI: Embed question
  A->>DB: Top-K vector search (workspace scoped)
  alt best score below threshold
    A->>DB: Save unsupported request
    A-->>F: 200 unsupported, empty sources
  else evidence supported
    A->>AI: Generate grounded answer from passive context
    A->>DB: Save request, citations and usage atomically
    A-->>F: 200 answer + sources + usage
  end
  F-->>U: Render answer with numbered citations

  Note over U,AI: Upload flow: multipart POST -> hash/type/limit validation -> 202 -> Celery extracts, chunks (400/50), embeds and marks ready/failed.
